---
import { surveyQuarter, surveyGeneratedDate, crossDomainRegions, citiesWithDetections } from "../data/stats";
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="border-t border-ink-300/30 bg-paper-alt mt-12">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-8 text-sm text-ink-500 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-4">
    <div>
      <p class="text-ink-700 font-medium">SolarMap.PH</p>
      <p>
        Open-source rooftop solar detection from public satellite imagery. Coverage: {citiesWithDetections} cities across Greater Metro Manila, plus {crossDomainRegions} regional franchises outside it. Free homeowner roof-lookup tool. Code MIT, data CC-BY-4.0. Not affiliated with Manila Electric Company.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="text-ink-700 font-medium">What this isn't</p>
      <p>
        Engineering advice. Site survey is your installer's job. The tool measures roof area from satellite, runs solar payback math at the current Meralco rate, and surfaces verified case studies; it doesn't replace a structural assessment, exact orientation reading, or a real quote.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="text-ink-700 font-medium">Found a bug?</p>
      <p>
        Open an issue or PR on <a href="https://github.com/xmpuspus/solar-map-ph" class="no-underline text-ink-700 hover:text-ink-900">GitHub</a>. Especially welcome: verified rooftop solar locations not in our case studies, LGU permit data not in our table, missing addresses.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="text-ink-700 font-medium">Privacy &amp; takedown</p>
      <p>
        <a href="/privacy" class="no-underline text-ink-700 hover:text-ink-900">Privacy &amp; responsible use</a> &middot;
        <a href="/faq" class="no-underline text-ink-700 hover:text-ink-900">FAQ</a> &middot;
        <a href="https://github.com/xmpuspus/solar-map-ph/issues/new?labels=takedown&amp;template=takedown.md" class="no-underline text-ink-700 hover:text-ink-900">request takedown</a>. DPO: xpuspus@gmail.com.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="md:col-span-4 text-xs text-ink-500 pt-4 border-t border-ink-300/20 leading-relaxed">
      <p class="mb-1">
        All data sourced from public records (Esri World Imagery, OpenStreetMap, ESA, Microsoft, NOAA, NASA). SolarMap.PH computes statistical indicators only. Patterns may have legitimate explanations. Imagery &copy; Esri, Maxar, Earthstar Geographics. Building data &copy; OpenStreetMap contributors. ODbL.
      </p>
      <p>
        &copy; {year} SolarMap.PH. Survey vintage {surveyQuarter}, generated {surveyGeneratedDate}. Cite as: SolarMap.PH ({surveyQuarter}), https://github.com/xmpuspus/solar-map-ph.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
